WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:08.955
Completed workstreams in a project shrink into narrow, faded cards. Their titles are smaller than the work still to do, making the delivered work harder to scan.

00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:21.704
Completed cards now have the same width and title size as open cards, with room for longer titles. The solid green background keeps finished work clear. Older projects make room wherever the larger cards would overlap.

00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:30.358
Zooming out keeps completed cards fully opaque, and their titles grow for the overview. Finished work stays visible alongside what comes next.
